---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import VideoBg from "../components/VideoBg.astro";
---

<Layout title="Stefon Diggs">
  <Nav />
  <section class="hero diggs">
    <div class="content__wrapper case"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="work">
    <div class="work_wrapper">
      <div class="work-title">
        <h2 class="h2">STEFON DIGGS</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="work_details">
        <ul role="list" class="list-2 work w-list-unstyled">
          <li class="list-title work">
            <div>SERVICES</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">VISUAL DESIGN</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">BRANDING</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">BRAND STRATEGY</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="work_intro">
          <p>More than a football player.<br><br>Stefon Diggs might be best known for his record breaking NFL career, but his passions also include fashion, charity, wellness, gaming and music. His personal brand needed to span all areas, aligning his purpose beyond public perception.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3646-267a7695" class="w-layout-layout work_grid wf-layout-layout">
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3647-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/diggs-mark.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3653-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/diggs-photo_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/diggs-photo_1diggs-photo.webp 500w, /images/diggs-photo_1diggs-photo.webp 800w, /images/diggs-photo_1diggs-photo.webp 1080w, /images/diggs-photo_1.webp 1440w" alt="Stefon Diggs"></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd365f-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/diggs-name.mp4" img="/images/diggs-name.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/diggs-name-p-500.png 500w, /images/diggs-name-p-800.png 800w, /images/diggs-name-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/diggs-name-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/diggs-name-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/diggs-name-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/diggs-name.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3669-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/diggs-poster.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_4e46d753-55c9-db65-bd2c-6db41309ac57-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/diggs-shape.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/diggs-shape-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/diggs-shape-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/diggs-shape-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/diggs-shape.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3675-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/diggs-mobile.mp4" img="/images/video-large.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/video-large-p-500.png 500w, /images/video-large-p-800.png 800w, /images/video-large-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/video-large-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/video-large-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/video-large-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/video-large.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_94f218bf-7c86-48a2-7318-804d19e60b76-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell">
          <div class="work_text">
            <p>We created a design that captures Stefon’s energy, expanding his reach beyond the world of sport. His brand needed to be instantly recognisable, in-line with his existing identity, and yet flexible enough to adapt and grow.<br><br>A logo mark that shows there’s more beyond what he’s best known for.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_4de8a0e5-ab81-d579-9dee-b09df83eaf5c-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/diggs-hat.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/diggs-hat-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/diggs-hat-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/diggs-hat-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/diggs-hat.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36ad-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/diggs-large.webp" sizes="90vw" srcset="/images/diggs-large-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/diggs-large-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/diggs-large-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/diggs-large-p-1600.jpg 1600w, /images/diggs-large-p-2000.jpg 2000w, /images/diggs-large-p-2600.jpg 2600w, /images/diggs-large.webp 3000w" alt="" class="image-3"></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36b9-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/diigs-boots_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/diigs-boots_1diigs-boots.webp 500w, /images/diigs-boots_1diigs-boots.webp 800w, /images/diigs-boots_1diigs-boots.webp 1080w, /images/diigs-boots_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_1c86ea96-e196-6e0d-c0e3-aaa12167a810-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/diggs-jacket.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/diggs-jacket-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/diggs-jacket-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/diggs-jacket-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/diggs-jacket.webp 1441w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-c919498d-959b-1740-bc47-c06d766d59dd-267a7695" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/diggs-blackout.mp4" img="/images/video-large.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/video-large-p-500.png 500w, /images/video-large-p-800.png 800w, /images/video-large-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/video-large-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/video-large-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/video-large-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/video-large.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="footer-line" class="footer-trigger"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
